<title>UK: WestLB unit sets 150 billion lire Oct 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB unit sets 150 billion lire Oct 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>THe following bond was announced by lead manager Cariplo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WEST LANDESBANK FINANCE CURACO</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  WEST LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    01.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.415   PAY DATE  S-27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P *AA1/AA+   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW ***ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     *OF GUARANTOR</p>
<p>	    **US/UK/DE/IT/N ANT</p>
<p>	   ***FOR SUBSCRIPTION AGREEMENT AND GERMAN IN NOTES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
